{"seq":12,"slug":"specialized-english","title":"专业领域英语","stage":"DONE","category":"english-learning","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.47,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 专业领域英语 简介\n\n英语作为全球通用的学术与商业语言，在各个专业领域中发展出了高度特化的词汇体系、表达惯例和文体规范。通用英语能力再强，如果缺少对特定领域术语和表达范式的掌握，在跨语言的专业交流中仍然会举步维艰。无论是阅读一份英文技术规格书、理解一篇金融分析报告，还是审阅一份英文合同条款，都需要超越通用英语的领域专属能力。本知识库正是为了帮助学习者系统建立这种能力——它不教基础语法和日常会话，而是聚焦五大核心专业领域中最高频、最实用的英语知识。\n\n本知识库面向已具备中级及以上英语水平的学习者，尤其适合程序员、金融从业者、法务人员、医学工作者和媒体人，以及任何需要在专业场景中使用英语进行阅读、写作或沟通的知识工作者。如果你能应对日常英语交流但在专业语境中频繁遇到术语障碍，这里的内容将为你提供系统的突破路径。\n\n全书共分五个章节：\n\n第一章**科技英语**覆盖编程术语体系、软件文档写作、技术沟通规范和开源社区英语四大主题，帮助技术人员在英文编码、文档撰写和国际协作中准确、专业地表达。\n\n第二章**金融英语**系统讲解银行业核心词汇、投资领域语言、财务报告用语和金融科技术语，为金融从业者和对金融感兴趣的学习者构建完整的行业英语框架。\n\n第三章**法律英语**深入法律体系词汇、合同起草用语、法庭程序术语和知识产权表达，揭示法律英语独特的文体特征和精确性要求。\n\n第四章**医学英语**涵盖解剖学术语、临床沟通用语、医学文献阅读和医疗体系相关表达，帮助医学工作者和跨领域学习者掌握医学英语的核心词汇与表达模式。\n\n第五章**传媒英语**探讨新闻写作、广播语言、社交媒体英语和广告文案四个方向，展现传媒领域英语在简洁性、感染力和受众适配上的独特要求。\n\n建议根据自身职业背景和需求选择章节重点攻读。如果你是程序员，第一章是最直接的切入点；如果你需要跨领域拓展，可以按顺序通读全书，每个领域的术语逻辑和表达范式都能为你打开一扇新的认知窗口。各章之间相互独立，也可以作为参考手册在实际工作中按需查阅。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tech-english","title":"科技英语","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/tech-english","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"programming-terminology","title":"编程术语体系","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/tech-english/programming-terminology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"software-documentation","title":"软件文档英语","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/tech-english/software-documentation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"technical-communication","title":"技术交流表达","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/tech-english/technical-communication"},{"seq":4,"slug":"open-source-english","title":"开源社区英语","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/tech-english/open-source-english"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"finance-english","title":"金融英语","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/finance-english","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"banking-vocabulary","title":"银行与金融词汇","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/finance-english/banking-vocabulary"},{"seq":2,"slug":"investment-language","title":"投资理财语言","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/finance-english/investment-language"},{"seq":3,"slug":"financial-reporting","title":"财务报告英语","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/finance-english/financial-reporting"},{"seq":4,"slug":"fintech-terms","title":"金融科技术语","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/finance-english/fintech-terms"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"legal-english","title":"法律英语","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/legal-english","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"legal-system-vocabulary","title":"法律体系与词汇","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/legal-english/legal-system-vocabulary"},{"seq":2,"slug":"contract-drafting","title":"合同起草英语","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/legal-english/contract-drafting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"court-proceedings","title":"庭审程序语言","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/legal-english/court-proceedings"},{"seq":4,"slug":"intellectual-property","title":"知识产权英语","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/legal-english/intellectual-property"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"medical-english","title":"医学英语","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/medical-english","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anatomy-terminology","title":"解剖学术语","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/medical-english/anatomy-terminology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"clinical-communication","title":"临床沟通英语","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/medical-english/clinical-communication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"medical-literature","title":"医学文献阅读","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/medical-english/medical-literature"},{"seq":4,"slug":"healthcare-systems","title":"医疗体系词汇","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/medical-english/healthcare-systems"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"media-english","title":"传媒英语","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/media-english","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"journalism-writing","title":"新闻写作英语","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/media-english/journalism-writing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"broadcast-language","title":"广播电视语言","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/media-english/broadcast-language"},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-media-english","title":"社交媒体英语","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/media-english/social-media-english"},{"seq":4,"slug":"advertising-copywriting","title":"广告文案英语","url":"/h/english-learning/specialized-english/media-english/advertising-copywriting"}]}]}